# Pokemon Card Designer - Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your API keys

# Option 1: Anthropic Claude API (recommended)
# Get your API key from https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# Option 2: OpenAI API
# Get your API key from https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Note: If no API key is provided, the app will use a mock generator
# that creates cards based on keywords in your prompt
